        "official_en_sha256": "46aa2f5700979bdfc96f512f185f9a09a1548792687fbb384da7d3310f093479"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "この岩……鎮め石って話を聞いたことがあるな。\r\nなにを封じているんだろうか……。\r\n場所は覚えておこう。",
        "official_en": "Hmm, I’ve heard about this before—it’s a sealing stone. I wonder what it seals though? We should remember the location in case we want to come back.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
