        "official_en_sha256": "19634ff7cb461f3b7c25b13bb12e9c296e3805d39ef58f27422a3985fa63e773"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "これぞまさに、\"地\"が騒ぐというやつだ！！\r\nがーっはっは！！",
        "official_en": "I shall gladly put them between a <text style=\"italic\">rock</> and a hard place, in the truest sense! Bwahahaha!",
        "real_en": "Now that's what I call the earth stirring in my veins! Gahahaha!"
      },
