      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ほう。\r\n我を倒すとは……。\r\nお前たち、只者ではないな。",
        "official_en": "Hmm... It appears you are no ordinary humans.",
        "real_en": "Oh? You managed to defeat me... You're no ordinary people."
