      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "必要なときに呼ぶがいい。\r\n今度はお前たちの敵に\r\n大地の怒りをぶつけてやろう。",
        "official_en": "Call upon me whenever you are in need, and I shall bring my full might to bear upon your foes.",
        "real_en": "Call me whenever you need me. Next time, I'll unleash the earth's fury against your enemies."
